  "title": "Grilled Beef Tenderloin with Herb-Garlic-Pepper Coating",
  "description": "This grilled beef tenderloin is served rosy pink and seasoned with a rosemary, garlic, and black pepper rub that creates a gorgeous crust on the beef.",
  "authors": [
    "USA WEEKEND columnist Pam Anderson"
  ],
