    "description": "In this video, Nicole shows you how to make a tender grilled beef tenderloin with a fresh herb rub. This recipe uses a charcoal or gas grill to sear and bake the tenderloin instead of a stovetop and oven. Combine together rosemary, dried thyme, garlic, salt, pepper, and olive oil to rub onto the tenderloin. Let the meat sear on the grill before letting it cook on the cooler side for around an hour. It’s a juicy summer meal that has immense flavor without adding any sauce!",
